  "observation": "Committed CP-SAT notebook revenues differ from the exact integer optimum on the instances flagged below, while the committed MILP (float path, scale-free) matches the exact optimum on 18/18 modulo 2-decimal display (paths_g30_b100_s10000: exact 13.125 shown as 13.12).",
  "instances_with_student_cp_delta_milli_nonzero": 10,
